<% layout('layout') -%><section class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">HELP CENTRE</div><h1>Helpful, honest parcel support</h1></section><section class="panel"><h2>Before requesting a parcel</h2><ul><li>Use accurate phone numbers and postal codes.</li><li>Pack items securely and check carrier restrictions.</li><li>Do not send OTPs, passwords, bank PINs or payment card secrets to anyone.</li><li>A request reference is not a live carrier tracking number.</li><li>Never pay a person claiming a booking is confirmed unless you can verify the provider and price.</li></ul></section><section class="panel"><h2>AI assistant</h2><p>The assistant can explain general steps, but cannot guarantee delivery, rates, customs clearance or carrier availability.</p></section>
